WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.927 --> 00:00:04.094
(singing)

00:00:06.241 --> 00:00:08.658
(chattering)

00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:12.093
- Sorry, I had added—

00:00:12.093 --> 00:00:12.926
- And a Sprite?

00:00:12.926 --> 00:00:13.759
- Yeah.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:14.592
- Okay.

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:23.200
- Uh huh, uh huh.

00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:30.887
(electronic music)

00:00:30.887 --> 00:00:33.554
♫ Oh the sorrow

00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:39.947
♫ I'm down in the world

00:00:40.864 --> 00:00:43.197
♫ All alone

00:00:44.912 --> 00:00:47.947
♫ And I have

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:51.197
♫ No home for tomorrow

00:00:52.843 --> 00:00:57.331
♫ I'm trying to make this city

00:00:57.331 --> 00:00:59.498
♫ My home

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:05.101
♫ Oh Lord, sometimes I'm gonna talk ♫

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:07.623
- What, what up?

00:01:08.918 --> 00:01:10.493
Trying to see what?

00:01:10.493 --> 00:01:12.743
What are you trying to see?

00:01:19.061 --> 00:01:21.176
We're just doing a documentary.

00:01:21.176 --> 00:01:22.343
A documentary!

00:01:23.753 --> 00:01:25.907
I'm Claressa's little sister!

00:01:25.907 --> 00:01:26.740
The boxer!

00:01:28.092 --> 00:01:31.207
No I'm her little sister, fool!

00:01:31.207 --> 00:01:32.040
Yeah!

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:33.760
Yeah!

00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:35.857
Yeah!

00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:38.404
Thank you!

00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:41.604
Good lookin', fam!

00:01:46.829 --> 00:01:49.806
- Welcome back everybody,
thank you so much!

00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:51.221
My guest tonight—

00:01:51.221 --> 00:01:52.652
- I am the best female boxer in the world.

00:01:52.652 --> 00:01:55.420
- Grew up in Flint, Michigan.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.429
- [Claressa] I have this dream.

00:01:56.429 --> 00:01:57.262
- In the world.

00:01:57.262 --> 00:01:58.095
- Little bit of pressure.

00:01:58.095 --> 00:01:58.973
- [Voiceover] For Claressa—

00:01:58.973 --> 00:01:59.957
She could be the first—

00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:01.947
Two Olympic gold medals—

00:02:01.947 --> 00:02:03.106
- Oh, I love ‘em.

00:02:03.106 --> 00:02:03.939
- [Voiceover] Claressa.

00:02:03.939 --> 00:02:04.772
- Claressa.

00:02:04.772 --> 00:02:05.605
- [Voiceover] Shields.

00:02:05.605 --> 00:02:06.456
- [Voiceover] Claressa Shields.

00:02:06.456 --> 00:02:08.950
- [Voiceover] Claressa Shields!

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.700
- Claressa, truly an inspiration.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:29.224
- [Briana] A lot of
people don't even know me.

00:02:29.224 --> 00:02:30.548
Like a lot of people just be like

00:02:30.548 --> 00:02:32.798
"that's Claressa's sister."

00:02:34.174 --> 00:02:36.693
I have no problem with
that, but don't be like

00:02:36.693 --> 00:02:38.491
"oh that's Claressa's
sister, she need to go do

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.021
what her sister doing."

00:02:40.021 --> 00:02:40.938
No I don't.

00:02:43.152 --> 00:02:46.972
Everybody always trying
to compare me to Claressa.

00:02:46.972 --> 00:02:48.639
But this is my life.

00:02:50.099 --> 00:02:52.682
(gentle music)

00:03:01.812 --> 00:03:03.206
- [Briana] But at the
same time, a lot of stuff

00:03:03.206 --> 00:03:06.789
that I think is okay,
it's really not okay.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.531
A lot of us in Flint
are stuck inside of our

00:03:10.531 --> 00:03:14.364
own world because we're
so used to struggling.

00:03:15.483 --> 00:03:17.349
I got used to my
momma throwing me out

00:03:17.349 --> 00:03:20.550
at three o'clock in the morning.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.383
I'm used to failing, and buying food stamps

00:03:23.383 --> 00:03:25.904
just to make ends meet.

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:29.404
I'm used to not having to listen to nobody

00:03:30.273 --> 00:03:34.440
because I was always kinda
doing alright by myself.

00:03:38.665 --> 00:03:40.498
When Claressa left me,

00:03:41.559 --> 00:03:45.395
I really took that shit
hard bro, I ain’t had nobody.

00:03:45.395 --> 00:03:50.096
But Claressa had to leave
to really succeed in life.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.308
I feel like Claressa
meant to be on TV and I'm

00:03:52.308 --> 00:03:54.558
meant to be in the streets.

00:03:55.872 --> 00:03:59.452
What if Claressa would
have stayed with me?

00:03:59.452 --> 00:04:02.869
What if Claressa ran the streets with me?

00:04:05.022 --> 00:04:08.022
We would both be fucked up out here

00:04:08.972 --> 00:04:10.389
with nothing.

00:04:18.161 --> 00:04:20.851
(giggling)

00:04:20.851 --> 00:04:23.101
(babbling)

00:04:40.398 --> 00:04:43.885
- [Briana] I never wanted my
son's name to be Bradford.

00:04:43.885 --> 00:04:46.693
He's been Fat Daddy since the womb.

00:04:46.693 --> 00:04:48.837
Before we even found out
if he was a boy or not

00:04:48.837 --> 00:04:50.254
he was Fat Daddy.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.526
Even if he was a, came out a
girl, he was still gonna be

00:04:54.526 --> 00:04:55.359
Fat Daddy.

00:04:55.359 --> 00:04:57.609
(giggling)

00:05:00.906 --> 00:05:03.073
(playing)

00:05:04.517 --> 00:05:05.517
- Fat Daddy!

00:05:06.925 --> 00:05:10.181
I'm a full time Fat Daddy mama.

00:05:10.181 --> 00:05:13.264
That's what I am, that's my life now.

00:05:16.051 --> 00:05:19.551
Fat Daddy come put your shoes on, come on!

00:05:23.628 --> 00:05:26.502
Fat Daddy I've been thinking of you!

00:05:26.502 --> 00:05:28.306
Are you thinking of me?

00:05:28.306 --> 00:05:30.889
(bright music)

00:06:06.967 --> 00:06:10.792
- He is so handsome with his haircut!

00:06:10.792 --> 00:06:12.563
His hair grow back
fast, so I might be back

00:06:12.563 --> 00:06:13.646
in two weeks!

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:19.043
Say "We out here!"

00:06:20.374 --> 00:06:22.624
(babbling)

00:06:25.108 --> 00:06:27.737
- Come here, look at me!

00:06:27.737 --> 00:06:28.904
Ooh, handsome!

00:06:33.618 --> 00:06:35.252
(laughing)

00:06:35.252 --> 00:06:37.330
You fat as hell.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.567
(babbling)

00:06:39.567 --> 00:06:41.783
- I wanted to get pregnant.

00:06:41.783 --> 00:06:44.366
(silly noises)

00:06:45.943 --> 00:06:47.912
- I wanted to have a baby because I felt

00:06:47.912 --> 00:06:50.631
abandoned by everybody.

00:06:50.631 --> 00:06:53.496
Everybody chose when they want to care

00:06:53.496 --> 00:06:55.182
and love me or whatever.

00:06:55.182 --> 00:06:57.682
So I said, if I have my own baby,

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.890
all he gonna want is me.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.331
All he gonna need is me.

00:07:03.331 --> 00:07:05.383
And all he gonna love is me, and he gonna

00:07:05.383 --> 00:07:06.994
keep on loving me till the day he die.

00:07:06.994 --> 00:07:10.800
He ain't gonna never stop,
I wanted my own baby.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.484
(babbling)

00:07:12.484 --> 00:07:15.151
- Whatever, we going to the zoo!

00:07:19.589 --> 00:07:21.922
(squealing)

00:07:25.209 --> 00:07:26.470
- We going to the mother fuckin' zoo!

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.485
(babbling)

00:07:28.485 --> 00:07:31.402
(electronic music)

00:07:37.417 --> 00:07:40.424
- [Briana] Claressa is really
living her life already.

00:07:40.424 --> 00:07:42.998
She got her shit together, now I gotta get

00:07:42.998 --> 00:07:44.355
my shit together.

00:07:44.355 --> 00:07:47.272
(electronic music)

00:07:55.555 --> 00:07:56.438
- [Briana] If I actually
wanna do something

00:07:56.438 --> 00:07:59.771
with my life, I'm capable of doing that.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:08.727
I can't let my situation define who I am.

00:08:10.884 --> 00:08:12.967
I can't let that make me.

00:08:17.974 --> 00:08:19.307
I'm a statistic.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:24.640
But that's not all I
am, I'm more than that.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:27.557
(electronic music)

